{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079230/extras/9412785560b406a7c205f69e57ae6fbe.poster.avif?t=1775827864\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079230/extras/9412785560b406a7c205f69e57ae6fbe.webm?t=1775827864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079230/extras/9412785560b406a7c205f69e57ae6fbe.mp4?t=1775827864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rogue-lite + Sandbox = <strong>Himno - The Silent Melody</strong></h2>Guide &quot;Fash&quot; on his quest to single-handedly take on the corrupted machines and rescue the other Guardians in a 2D rogue-lite platformer packed with atmospheric action and building.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079230/extras/c04c2413cf222a5bc476ac8c1c52e92f.poster.avif?t=1775827864\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079230/extras/c04c2413cf222a5bc476ac8c1c52e92f.webm?t=1775827864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079230/extras/c04c2413cf222a5bc476ac8c1c52e92f.mp4?t=1775827864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore different interconnected environments with the replayability of a roguelite game while gathering materials to create your unique arsenal of weapons.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079230/extras/e02404036c49191e0432de0cae4ca49a.poster.avif?t=1775827864\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://sh